<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Operation Baltic Vigilance, 2020</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;Operation Baltic Vigilance&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt; by Skjold (SwAF vs. Estonia)&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;IMG alt=http://i.imgur.com/JqCyDQX.jpg src="http://i.imgur.com/JqCyDQX.jpg"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;Situation&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Sweden and Estonia is&amp;nbsp;holding a joint Airforce and Navy exercise to increase the combat readyness of both nations. Sweden will simulate a&amp;nbsp;squadron sized attack with a force consisting of&amp;nbsp;the newest airplanes and&amp;nbsp;weaponry.&amp;nbsp;Estonia military mostly consists of hand downs from NATO allies and&amp;nbsp;Sweden. as they have little funding to procure the most modern and effective equipment. This makes their military somewhat dated, but&amp;nbsp;Estonia still&amp;nbsp;has excellent radar coverage and quite a&amp;nbsp;formidable SAM net.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;Mission&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;You are tasked to destroy several key military and civil infrastructure targets deep inside Estonia, these will be protected by enemy aircraft and SAM sites. Destroying radar installations, SAM&amp;nbsp;sites&amp;nbsp;and airplanes&amp;nbsp;is&amp;nbsp;your&amp;nbsp;secondary objectives.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;U&gt;Notes&lt;/U&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;This mission assumes that Estonia has greatly expanded its military and recieved hand downs / bought new equipment in the timespan between 2015-2020. All systems used by them in this scenario with the exception of ground radar and Mistral ATLAS is fictional.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Thanks to &lt;A class=subhead style="TEXT-DECORATION: none; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(0,0,80); FONT: bold 12px Verdana; WIDOWS: 1; LETTER-SPACING: normal; TEXT-INDENT: 0px; font-stretch: normal; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px" href="http://www.matrixgames.com/forums/showProfile.asp?memid=47862" target=_blank&gt;ThunderCBR&lt;/A&gt;&amp;nbsp;for hes excellent Estonian installation imports.&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
